  "refreshLab": "Refresh",
  "refreshLabBody": "**refresh** is always **invalidate** plus an immediate **read**. That is why refresh returns a Future. Use **refresh** when this callback must wait. **Pull-to-refresh** is the usual case.\n\nUse **invalidate** when you do not need to wait. It marks the provider stale. Whoever **watch**es it reloads. That is the usual choice after a mutation: save, delete, logout, or any time the cache is old.\n\n**Refresh** and **Refresh 3x** disable while they wait so you cannot stack taps. **Invalidate** stays tappable.\n\n**Invalidate 3x** starts one GET. **Refresh 3x** starts three. The **Refresh** button blinks once. **Refresh 3x** blinks three times.",
